// Highlights-in-the-book-note (v0.4.0 / v0.4.1). Colour is shown with a
// plugin-styled callout (`> [!a4-hl-<colour>]`, CSS in styles.css draws only
// a coloured left bar, no title/icon) rather than a word+emoji -- v0.4.0's
